{"id":"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-omega-rule.md","title":"The Omega Rule","display":"df-omega-rule — The Omega Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-omega-rule","aliases":["89-df-omega-rule"],"display":"df-omega-rule — The Omega Rule","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-omega-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-omega-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-rule — The Omega Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的语言包含自然数数词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}_T\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml}_T\\)</span> 是该语言有限公式集，可包含二阶变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x)\">\\(A(x)\\)</span> 的全部自由变元至多为一个数变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\bar n/x]\">\\(A[\\bar n/x]\\)</span> 避免捕获。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_\\omega^T\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left(\\{A[\\bar n/x]\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\forall xA\\right)\n\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_T,\\ \\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_\\omega^T\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left(\\{A[\\bar n/x]\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\forall xA\\right)\n\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_T,\\ \\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 14 章，印刷页 177–180；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n前提是可数无限集合，故本规则不属于原有有限前提的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nec}\\)</span> 或 MP 规则关系。使用完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 闭包与只使用一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml}_T","display":false},{"tex":"A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"A[\\bar n/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}rule}\\vdash\n\\mathcal R_\\omega^T\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left(\\{A[\\bar n/x]\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\forall xA\\right)\n\\mid A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_T,\\ \\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1093,"backlinks":[{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]] → [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] → [[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["a257e5b1de6880b7"]}